@@ -9286,3 +9286,4 @@ Did NOT modify research-roadmap.yaml or scripts/research_conductor.py. Did NOT p
 - 2026-06-18: PHASE C (CONTINUOUS SELF-LEARNING; mandated; BUILD ON the .402 win) -- DEPLOY the learned action-cost heuristic into the standing planner + PROVE it COMPOUNDS, with an LLM-generated-heuristic stronger-arm probe. .402 (exp4353) PROVED the mechanism: a learned A* action-cost heuristic trained on solved-level traces cut HELD-OUT env-actions-to-solve 25->16 (positive control passed, reproduction-gated, verifier_is_oracle=false). The PRD's continuous-self-learning vision is learning that COMPOUNDS at inference speed ('Carnot must get smarter over time; every solve makes the next faster'). .403 advances it two ways: (1) DEPLOY -- wire the learned action-cost heuristic into arc_solver_kit as the standing A* cost so EVERY future ARC solve is action-minimal by default; (2) PROVE IT COMPOUNDS -- measure held-out env-actions-to-solve as a FUNCTION of the number of solved-level traces in the training corpus (a learning curve: does more experience -> fewer actions on held-out levels?), with the positive control distinguishing 'compounds' from 'no-headroom'. Optional stronger-arm probe: an LLM-generated heuristic PROGRAM per game (arXiv:2503.18809 classical planning with LLM-generated heuristics) selected by reproduced held-out action count, vs the linear heuristic -- on FRESH held-out levels with static-analysis receipts + reproduction gates. Emit action_efficiency_compounds BARE bool := (held-out actions-to-solve DECREASES as the solved-trace corpus grows, positive control confirming headroom). verifier_is_oracle=false. Cross-game VALUE-TRANSFER is RETIRED (exp4342); this is the WORKING per-game mechanism DEPLOYED + measured for compounding. NO TRM training. (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=success: action_efficiency_compounds_25_to_16; results/experiment_4364_self_learning_action_cost_compounds.json
 - 2026-06-18: PHASE E1 (SOTA-ingestion; mandatory per SOTA-Ingestion Cycle Discipline) -- ingest the SOTA for the .403 bleeding-edge forks (Prism-hardened verifier-guided diffusion-LM search; E3 executable-world-model deeper/multi-game ARC solves; compounding learned action-efficiency heuristics) and MAP the strongest 3-5 methods onto the .404 roadmap, conditioned on the .403 outcomes (did the Prism-hardened search CONVERT the moat to a fixed-NFE generation gain? did E3 reach deeper/tail levels? did the action-cost heuristic COMPOUND?). Use the RELIABLE channel ONLY (scripts/sweep_clusters.py / sweep_semscholar.py + low-concurrency WebSearch/WebFetch) -- /deep-research is BANNED in-loop. Every method MUST carry a real, VERIFIED arXiv ID/URL (no citation = fabrication). FLAG A2D2 (2606.13565) + SEPO (2502.01384) verifier-as-reward GENERATOR-training as OUT-OF-BAND/operator-owned (NOT auto-run in-loop). Update research-studying.md (mark ingested) and emit flagged_for_v404 (the single strongest method for the .404 planner). (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: sota_ingestion_v404_mapped; results/experiment_4365_sota_ingestion_v404.json
 - 2026-06-18: PHASE E2 (INFRA/HYGIENE) -- registry/gaps hygiene + GAP-4 regression guard. (1) Reconcile ops/verifier_registry.yaml + ops/verifier_gaps.md + ops/arc_solve_registry.yaml with the .403 outcomes (the S3->Prism moat-utility result, new ARC reproduced levels from exp4361-4363, the compounding action-cost heuristic exp4364, any new missing-verifier gaps logged). (2) Run the GAP-4 regression guard (the ARC oracle-distinct verifier-beats-vote result must not silently regress). (3) Verify the capstone verifier_is_oracle stamping fix is STILL durable (the .402 exp4355 fix made the .402 capstone scan 0 flags; confirm the .403 capstone path inherits it). NO production verifier edits (audit-only per Verifier Authenticity Discipline). (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: registry_gaps_arc_reconciled_to_v403_truth_gap4_guard_passed_True_capstone_stamp_fix_durable_True; results/experiment_4366_registry_gaps_hygiene_gap4_guard.json
+- 2026-06-18: PHASE E3 (HARDWARE CONTINUITY; KV260 opportunistic per north-star §3) -- KV260 SSH-reachability + loaded-bitstream continuity check. Per north-star §3, KV260 is THE sovereignty story (drive to terminal, then freeze); GateMate/PolarFire are opportunistic-only. SSH-reachability precondition ONLY (NEVER a host SD-card precondition per KV260 SSH-Not-SD-Card Discipline). If the board is reachable, record the loaded overlay (xmutil listapps) + a lightweight liveness check (the carnot_ising bitstream UIO device present); if it is the terminal board-latency transcript, capture it. If unreachable -> honest_verdict blocked_kv260_ssh_unreachable (a clean documented skip, NOT a fabrication). This keeps the board visible in the milestone retro without burning a deep task slot. NO host SD-card-device precondition (the retired mechanism). NO TRM training. (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=success_kv260_continuity_terminal_reached; results/experiment_4367_hardware_continuity_kv260.json
